,8,10,10,65,1Style: Kanji-furigana-OPı,Duality,18,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Editing FeesoDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Timing KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Quality Control Feeso Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Sewil TheFVguyDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Translation Gaijin FUNimationDialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:57.26,Title-480p,,0,0,160,,The Town of Beginnings and EndingsDialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:01:58.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You raised your price again?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:03.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're charging too much!Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:08.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Raise it again and I'll cancel my subscription!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:16.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal? It's just a paper or two.Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:18.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It builds up when you get it everyday!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:21.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You don't need to save up...Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:25.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,to buy your village from Arlong anymore, remember?Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.05,0:02:27.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's no need to be stingy.Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're so dumb!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.59,0:02:33.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now that's over, I can finally earn money for myself!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:38.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be a poor pirate who can't even dress up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.05,0:02:40.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, simmer down!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:43.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to concentrate on  developing my special Tabasco Star!Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:49.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,An eyeful of this will make any bad guy-Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:56.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Just one!Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.61,0:02:58.11,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,Water! Water! Water!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:58.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:03:00.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is Nami-san's tangerine orchard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:03.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone lay a finger on it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:06.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Nothing will get  past my loving protection!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:09.08,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Thanks, Sanji-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:13.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,She's got him wrapped around her finger.Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:19.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Just one tangerine!Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're so mean, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:22.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I said no!Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.31,0:03:26.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever! I'm in too good a mood to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:33.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The world sure is chaotic these days. Another coup in Villa...Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:37.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A flyer?Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:58.46,Captions-480p,,50,0,350,,Navy Headquarters  Operated by the  World GovernmentDialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:15.56,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So, they're too much for local branches to handle?Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:19.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Correct. Before forming his pirate crew,Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:23.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,he bested Captain Axe-Hand Morgan,Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:26.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and he's shown no signs of slowing since.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:29.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Clown, 15 million.Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:33.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Pirate Commodore Don Krieg. 17 million.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:37.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sawtooth Arlong of the  Fishman Pirates. 20 million.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:46.01,Captions-480p,,0,0,5,,Commander Brannew Navy HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:41.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The average bounty in the East Blue  is 3 million belly, but theseDialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:47.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,notorious pirates, worth more than  10 million each, were taken down!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:52.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,30 million as a starting bounty is unprecedented,Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:55.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but we believe it's necessary.Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We must nip this evil in the bud now,Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.97,0:05:00.82,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,before it gets out of hand!Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:05.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Agreed.Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:09.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're wanted criminals!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:12.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It says I'm worth 30 million belly!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.99,0:05:18.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Look! I'm gonna be seen around the  world! Girls might fall for me!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:21.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! They included  Long Nose but left me out?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:26.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where are you?! I don't see you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:28.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,See!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.87,0:05:32.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's just the back of your head. It's nothing to brag about.Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:34.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sour! If you're a big enough threat,Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.98,0:05:37.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,you can get one of these without being a captain.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:40.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just keep tryin'!Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:46.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's head for the Grand Line, men!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:51.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yet again, you guys are missing how serious this is!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:54.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All of our lives are in danger now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:06:00.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Although, this is no time to be taking it easy in the East Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.14,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,30 million belly.Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:08.79,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Navy HQ is sure to take action with a number that high...Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.79,0:06:11.68,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,and we'll be swarmed with strong bounty hunters.Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:15.69,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,This'll be beyond what we've faced before.Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:21.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mistress!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mistress Kaya!Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:27.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mistress!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:29.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Merry?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.86,0:06:31.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:34.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp-san!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:39.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's definitely Usopp-san facing the other way!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:42.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, you're right...Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:48.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Finally!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.88,0:06:52.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san! You've taken the first step towards your dream!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:57.89,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy! The man who's gonna be king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.27,0:07:04.23,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:09.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But the next time we meet, we'll be on opposite sides!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:47.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're finally approaching the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:51.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's a famous settlement  on this island... Loguetown.Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:53.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Loguetown?Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's known as the Town of Beginnings and Endings.Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:58.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Its reputation precedes itself.Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:05.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the king of the pirates, was born and executed in that town.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:11.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The town where the pirate king died.Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wanna check it out?Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:17.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I have to see it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The man who got the One Piece—Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:22.48,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,everything the world has to offer—Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:25.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,was born and executed there!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:40.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to flee, should do so now!Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This bastion of peace will not...Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:45.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,tolerate any weakness during this age of piracy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.31,0:08:50.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The people that fall prey to villains need us! We are justice!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No matter what kind of evil roams the seas,Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:58.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,we marines must be prepared to fend it off without mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,In the name of absolute justice!Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:07.27,Note-480p,,0,0,0,,"Justice"Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:05.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:11.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wow! What a huge town!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:16.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Pirates used to stop here on their way to the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So it has everything you could need!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.74,0:09:19.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:24.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get some gear for our next great adventure!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:27.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Looks like I can stock up on fresh ingredients.Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:28.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fresh women, too!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:31.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's something I wanna buy, too.Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.03,0:09:35.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh? How are you gonna do that? Aren't you broke?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:38.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Alright! I'm gonna check out the execution platform!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:38.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:43.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see where the pirate king was executed!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:46.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! We haven't decided  where we're meeting up yet!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:49.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Man, that guy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:55.49,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,The king of the pirates was born here and died here!Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:58.45,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,He might've walked down this very street!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.49,0:10:04.45,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn, these are expensive! Too expensive!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:06.37,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,Lend you money?Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.73,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,No problem!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.73,0:10:11.79,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,Just remember, you'll hafta pay me 300% interest!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:15.01,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,But I can't enter the Grand Line with just one sword...Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:18.20,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,But I can't enter the Grand Line with just one sword...Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:20.47,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,What do I do?Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:20.47,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,"Monster"?! That's quite rude!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:27.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Shut it! Our boss is behind bars because of him!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:28.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You should have taken that as a lesson!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:32.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No way! We ain't satisfied leaving things be!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:36.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're gonna drag your corpse to him as payback!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:38.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Very well. I will fight you.Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:39.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Will you now, girlie?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:41.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't make us laugh!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:44.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What can a girl possibly do?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:44.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Die!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:46.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,She did it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.06,0:11:08.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's one strong lady!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:16.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if she's strong or lucky!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:18.36,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,My glasses! Where are my glasses!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My glasses...Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey. You looking for these?Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:25.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry for the trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:28.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:31.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How's this?Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:33.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh! You look wonderful, miss!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:34.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How's this?Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:36.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's so elegant, miss!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:37.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And this?Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:39.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Elemental, miss!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:39.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This one?Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:40.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Electrifying!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:41.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How's this one?Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Elegiac!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Will you be purchasing all of these?Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.47,0:11:46.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't want 'em.Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They're too extravagant for my taste.Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Come again!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:54.10,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh! A top-quality aperitif!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:57.61,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh! Two champagne-like bubbly beauties!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:12:01.73,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,The whole town's like a buffet!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:05.66,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn, I can't decide what to go for first!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:10.29,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,I think I just found the main dish!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:12.54,Note-480p,,0,0,0,,"Love-Love Pirates"Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:17.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Awesome! What is this place?! It's like a collector's dream!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:19.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Welcome!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everything here once belonged to famous pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:25.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,who returned alive from the Grand Line!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:28.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They are incredibly valuable.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:32.56,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All these items were used during  adventures on the Grand Line?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's correct!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:38.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We only do business with the bravest sea warriors here,Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.75,0:12:42.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,so it'll be a pleasure to serve a gentleman such as yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.10,0:12:47.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What do you say? This was Gold Roger's favorite gun!Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:50.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What?! Gold Roger's?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.61,0:12:51.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:55.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Are you interested, sir?Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:56.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,S-Show me everything!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My pleasure!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:04.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where are we going exactly?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You broke my glasses.Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:11.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I told you. I'll pay you back... somehow.Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:14.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You don't look like you have any money!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Something about you just seems off!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:19.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-True, I don't have any now, but...Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Those shadows under your eyes!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:23.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You look like you haven't eaten for days!Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:27.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is your mother sick?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:31.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Or maybe your wife ran out leaving you to raise all five kids alone?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,L-Listen, you!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:36.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't need the details! Just come with me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.05,0:13:43.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-The Navy?Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:46.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here.Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.07,0:13:51.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If you work for the Navy, you'll never  need to worry about money!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:54.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Screw that! Why would I wanna be a marine?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:58.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're just going to take off?! I'm trying to do you a favor here!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Look, you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:03.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Chief Petty Officer! It's time for training!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:05.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Later! Please work hard, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:07.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Chief Petty Officer?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:11.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I'm gettin' nowhere like this!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.99,0:14:18.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Even three-mop style is the best!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let me try again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You! What are you doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I knew it! You're Pirate Hunter Zoro!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.67,0:14:38.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why the heck are you cleaning?Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:43.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Intel says you've joined  Monkey D. Luffy's crew!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:44.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.95,0:14:54.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well... now what?Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:58.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What happened here?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.39,0:15:03.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It seems someone attacked them! There's no trace of the assailant!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.27,0:15:09.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,"For your glasses."Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.92,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Man, that freaked me out...Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.92,0:15:19.61,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Dammit! She looks way too much like Kuina!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:22.55,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Not to mention she's a swordsman, too...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:26.15,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Anything's possible I guess, but I doubt I'll ever see her again.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.23,0:15:35.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'd like some swords.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:40.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, Yes, yes! Welcome! Examine  anything that catches your eye!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.87,0:15:43.50,Captions-480p,,0,0,5,,Ipponmatsu Weapons MerchantDialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, Our shop's been in business for 200 years!Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:48.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I have 100,000 belly. Sell me two swords.Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:51.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Eh? Two for 100,000?Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:54.47,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's a bum.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:58.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,50,000 a sword'll only get you some dull blades.Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll make do with whatever. I just can't afford anything else.Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:06.83,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,You'll make do with whatever? Hmph! What a novice!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:11.19,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,That sword on his waist! Could it be?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.19,0:16:17.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,H-Hey there. L-Lemme see  that sword of y-y-yours!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:19.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why're you stammering like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.95,0:16:21.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,J-Just let me see!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:23.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Weirdo.Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:27.04,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,T-This really is it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:31.79,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,C-Calm down! This is a big chance!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:35.43,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,An absolute novice just waltzed  in with a named blade!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:37.72,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,You need to play it cool!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:41.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Say, this isn't a bad sword!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:45.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What do you say? I'll take it off you for 200,000 belly.Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:48.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Then you'll have 300,000 total!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.33,0:16:51.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You could get three nice blades at 100,000 apiece!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:54.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What're you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:59.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A-Alright! I-I'll  make it 250,000! No, 300,000!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:02.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,500,000?Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:05.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Look. Raise the price all you want, this sword isn't-Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:08.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Alright, then! I'll buy it from you for 650,000 belly!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:14.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fine, you damn haggler! How does 800,000 belly sound?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:15.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hello!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:18.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Did you finish polishing Shigure?Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:22.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! You're all right!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.47,0:17:27.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Someone went on a rampage at the naval outpost earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:29.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You were missing so I was worried!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:33.03,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,How dense can she be?Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:33.03,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! That's such a relief.Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:35.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But the fact you're safe and sound...Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:39.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,means that you must've left earlier, abandoning my kind offer!Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:42.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here, take your money back.Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.53,0:17:45.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't accept money from someone that cold.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.54,0:17:48.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Besides, I already bought some new glasses!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:53.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Isn't that katana the Wado Ichimonji?Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:56.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It really is Wado Ichimonji!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.30,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Wado?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.05,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't say it! Don't say it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:05.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful temper line!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:07.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's one of the 21 excellent wazamono blades!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:14.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,See! Look at this! It's worth no less than 10 million belly!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.96,0:18:17.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But what are you doing with such a legendary sword?Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:20.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn you! You had to go and run your mouth!Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:23.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I should sue for obstruction of business!Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,O-Obstruction of business?Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:27.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Did I say something wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:32.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're here for Shigure, right?! I'm done polishing it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:33.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Take it and get the hell out!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:40.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why did you run straight into those?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:41.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:44.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That clutz saved you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:47.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that a clueless guy like you...Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.56,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,is running around with a named blade without realizing its value.Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:53.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All the swords in that barrel are 50,000 belly apiece!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:55.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just pick whatever two you want!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.57,0:18:58.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's he so mad about?Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:02.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You must really like swords, to want to carry three of them!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:05.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of that one bounty hunter!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:06.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A bounty hunter?Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:09.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He's infamous! His name is Roronoa!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:10.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I hear the name a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.22,0:19:15.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right. He's a swordsman renowned all throughout the East Blue,Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:16.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but he's a ruthless brute!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:20.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Using swordsmanship for something as petty as bounty-hunting?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.63,0:19:23.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why're the forces of evil so strong in this era?Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:27.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All the famous sword masters are pirates or bounty hunters.Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:31.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And almost all of the world's named blades are in their hands.Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.48,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's a real shame.Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.87,0:19:39.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I dunno. Everyone has their own circumstances, right?Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.00,0:19:42.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You have to do what you can to survive.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:45.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well, with Shigure in my hands,Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:47.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hone my swordsmanship...Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.60,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and someday I'll retrieve all the named blades...Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,from the criminals of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:57.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The 12 supreme wazamonos, the 21 excellent wazamonos,Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:58.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and the 50 great wazamonos.Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.99,0:20:00.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll risk my life for them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.99,0:20:04.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You gonna take this katana, too? Wado Ichimonji, was it?Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:10.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like I want named blades out of greed.Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.69,0:20:14.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying I don't want criminals to wield them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:20.65,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,This sword...Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.75,0:20:23.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That sword! I think it's...Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.61,0:20:28.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I thought so! Kitetsu III!Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:29.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's Kitetsu III!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:33.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, Its predecessor, Kitetsu II, is an excellent wazamono,Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:36.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and Kitetsu I before that is listed as a supreme wazamono!Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.81,0:20:41.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mister! Is this sword really only 50,000 belly?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:46.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Incredible! It's a great wazamono, you know!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:48.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That one! You have to buy that one!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:51.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It normally goes for one million belly!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:54.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's an absolute no-brainer!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.34,0:20:56.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,N-No! I can't sell it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:21:01.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's right! Selling this for 50,000 belly is clearly a mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.04,0:21:02.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what I mean!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.07,0:21:13.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's cursed...Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:16.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You knew?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:19.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No. I can tell.Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:21.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,From their first incarnation,Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:26.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,every Kitetsu has been outstanding, but each of them carries a curse!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:31.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Many famous master swordsmen have met tragic deathsDialogue: 0,0:21:31.18,0:21:33.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,after taking up a Kitetsu katana.Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:37.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,These days, there ain't a single person who'd use a Kitetsu.Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:41.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Because they'll end your life before you know it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:46.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I just wanna get rid of the thing, but I'm afraid it'll curse me...Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:50.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! I had no idea it was such a terrifying sword!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:51.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I should've minded my own business!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.53,0:21:56.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's perfect! I'll take it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:21:59.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A-Are you a moron?! I can't sell it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.91,0:22:03.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If you die because of it,  it'd be like I killed you myself!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:07.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're the moron! Just get the sale!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:08.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Honey!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.58,0:22:10.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's test it out.Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:13.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My luck, or this thing's curse?Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.09,0:22:16.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We'll find out which is stronger.Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:21.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:27.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Stop! It's sharp enough to take your arm off!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:46.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll take it.Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:54.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey. Could you pick another one for me?Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:56.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,S-Sure...Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:22:58.48,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,H-Hold it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:09.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This blade has an uneven finish...Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:11.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and a black lacquered sheath!Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.25,0:23:16.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The great wazamono Yubashiri!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:21.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My shop may not be much, but this is the finest sword I own!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.77,0:23:24.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't afford it. I already told you, I got no money.Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:28.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Forget the money. And I don't need any for the Kitetsu, either.Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:31.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for trying to cheat you earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:34.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've looked into  the eyes of a true swordsman.Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They say a sword chooses its wielder anyway.Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.22,0:23:38.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll be praying for your good fortune!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:50.19,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,I definitely feel more at ease with three swords.Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:51.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's this?Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:55.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't believe a miser like you gave a treasure like that away!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.51,0:23:58.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with a man entrusting his dreams to another?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:01.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just take out the damn trash!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.77,0:24:02.92,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.92,0:24:06.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I was so frightened... I still can't stand up...Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.26,0:24:15.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.01,0:24:19.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Lemme see.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:29.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hawk Eye! What're you doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.31,0:24:33.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Calm down. I have no qualms with you.Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:35.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where is your boss?Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.77,0:24:42.08,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Camping out on an island like this... How carefree.Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.51,0:24:48.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,B-B-Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.01,0:25:01.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I-It's Hawk Eye!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.56,0:25:09.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Hawk Eye. This is unexpected...Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:14.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You caught me at a bad time... Have you come to challenge me?Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.73,0:25:18.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of settling our duel;Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.23,0:25:20.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,now that you're missing your left arm.Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.21,0:25:24.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I encountered an interesting pirate,Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:27.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,he reminded me of a story you told me once.Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.07,0:25:33.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was about a boy from some small village.Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.26,0:25:35.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You don't mean!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.41,0:25:44.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So you've made it, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.56,0:25:49.44,Captions-480p,,0,0,160,, Captain "Red-Haired" Shanks Red Hair PiratesDialogue: 0,0:25:47.43,0:25:49.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,In that case, Hawk Eye...Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.21,0:25:55.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't just let you leave.Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.33,0:26:03.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Hawk Eye?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.19,0:26:07.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right! Now drink up! It's time to celebrate!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.89,0:26:09.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I thought you had a hangover?Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.38,0:26:11.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it! There's always room to make a toast!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:13.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,C'mon now! C'mon now!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.36,0:26:16.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just gulp it straight down!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.57,0:26:21.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's the way! Let's drink! Down the hatch!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.05,0:26:22.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.10,0:26:23.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But, wait! Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.35,0:26:26.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You said you felt sick 'cause you drank too much before!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:30.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You dolt! How could I not drink on a joyous day like today!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:31.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The sun's still up.Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.84,0:26:33.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.29,0:26:35.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's party!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.99,0:26:44.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy's a wanted man now!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.02,0:26:45.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Good for him!Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.87,0:26:48.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This village might become known for being the home of a famous pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.95,0:26:50.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That'd be great!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.42,0:26:53.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you miscreants!Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.27,0:26:54.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mayor!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.59,0:26:58.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's so good about a criminal hailing from our village?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.05,0:27:00.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A toast!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.97,0:27:05.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Honestly! Every last one of them!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.03,0:27:10.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mayor! Luffy looks so happy here!Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:12.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A pirate's a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.69,0:27:17.32,Flashbacks-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.73,0:27:22.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sure, but it's his dream. Does that worry you?Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.53,0:27:27.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,His dream... or fate?Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power...Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:05.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the king of the pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:07.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,obtained everything the world had to offer.Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:11.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,His final words lured all sorts of adventurers to the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:15.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My treasure?  It's yours, if you can find it.Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:19.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everything is right where I left it!Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:26.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now pirates head for the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The world has entered...Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,the Great Pirate Era!Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.08,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.08,0:00:30.33,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.08,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.08,0:00:34.92,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.73,0:00:34.67,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.67,0:00:34.97,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.78,0:00:34.72,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 2,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.02,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 1,0:00:29.83,0:00:34.77,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 2,0:00:34.77,0:00:35.07,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 1,0:00:29.88,0:00:34.82,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 2,0:00:34.82,0:00:35.12,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 1,0:00:29.93,0:00:34.87,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, gaDialogue: 2,0:00:34.87,0:00:35.17,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, gaDialogue: 1,0:00:29.98,0:00:34.92,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,thDialogue: 2,0:00:34.92,0:00:35.22,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,thDialogue: 1,0:00:30.03,0:00:34.97,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,erDialogue: 2,0:00:34.97,0:00:35.27,Lyri